sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Flutter UI
    participant FBA as Firebase Auth
    participant API as ElysiaJS API
    participant DB as Neon DB

    Note over UI,DB: ── Email / Password Register ──

    UI->>API: POST /auth/register {email, password}
    API->>DB: INSERT users {email, hashed_password}
    DB-->>API: user record
    API-->>UI: JWT token
    UI->>UI: store JWT (secure storage)
    UI->>UI: navigate → Setup Profile

    Note over UI,DB: ── Google Sign-In ──

    UI->>FBA: signInWithGoogle()
    FBA-->>UI: idToken
    UI->>API: POST /auth/google {idToken}
    API->>FBA: verifyIdToken(idToken)
    FBA-->>API: decoded user info
    API->>DB: UPSERT users
    DB-->>API: user record
    API-->>UI: JWT token
    UI->>UI: store JWT (secure storage)

    alt First login → no display_name yet
        UI->>UI: navigate → Setup Profile
        UI->>API: PUT /auth/profile {display_name, promptpay_number, avatar_url}
        API->>DB: UPDATE users
        DB-->>API: updated user
        API-->>UI: success
        UI->>UI: navigate → Home
    else Returning user
        UI->>UI: navigate → Home
    end
